# fb-geometry-80g.patch (2026-11-19)
# Per-card FB geometry for the 8 GB CMP 170HX (10de:20c2): a card whose own floorsweep leaves 10 of
# its 12 FB partitions active gets LMR 0x28B and 80 GiB; every other card keeps the values the
# unlocker writes today (64 GiB). Kill switch: NVreg_RegistryDwords CmpFbGeometry=0. Log only:
# CmpFbGeometry=2.
# Applies with patch -p1 to NVIDIA open-gpu-kernel-modules 615.71.09 after the cmpunlocker patch set
# (github.com/amoghmunikote/cmpunlocker at 2c7e2ec, after ecc-reporting.patch). It also applies after
# p2p-unlock.patch on the Morrowmake fork's p2p-ecc branch (87cb5fd). See driver/README.md.
# License: GPL v2, like the cmpunlocker patches it builds on (driver/LICENSE). The modified files
# keep their original NVIDIA license notices.
